1
00:00:05,968 --> 00:00:12,628
Trip to Switzerland!

2
00:00:12,874 --> 00:00:19,336
On the way to the main train station

3
00:00:23,004 --> 00:00:27,218
Sandwich for breakfast

4
00:00:29,912 --> 00:00:34,556
Now off to Switzerland!

5
00:00:35,101 --> 00:00:43,876
I’m going on this trip with a friend who is also graduating this semester 

6
00:00:44,645 --> 00:00:49,917
It’s been 7 years since I first came to Germany

7
00:00:50,066 --> 00:00:56,957
And I didn’t get to travel a lot 

8
00:00:57,180 --> 00:01:05,129
Since this is my last year in Freiburg and Switzerland is super close by

9
00:01:05,494 --> 00:01:10,105
I spontaneously decided to go to Switzerland as a graduation trip 

10
00:01:12,187 --> 00:01:17,558
Scenery outside makes me super excited

11
00:01:17,786 --> 00:01:23,289
About 3 hours later, we’re in Interlaken

12
00:01:23,553 --> 00:01:28,329
We have some time left till the check in 

13
00:01:28,330 --> 00:01:36,444
So we decided to put our bags in the locker and went to have lunch

14
00:01:44,325 --> 00:01:49,828
It’s just like a painting 

15
00:01:50,424 --> 00:01:56,489
It really feels like we’re in Switzerland 🇨🇭

16
00:01:57,745 --> 00:02:03,447
We didn’t plan anything too specific so we’re walking towards the city center

17
00:02:08,074 --> 00:02:13,875
Perfect weather✨

18
00:02:18,535 --> 00:02:28,137
Even the color of the lake is pretty 

19
00:02:28,343 --> 00:02:33,582
We’re getting close to the center 

20
00:02:33,722 --> 00:02:38,201
You can even see people paragliding🪂

21
00:02:44,290 --> 00:02:52,173
Wow,, 

22
00:03:01,419 --> 00:03:06,459
Me as a tourist couldn’t just pass by the gift shop 

23
00:03:09,335 --> 00:03:17,185
They have cute little fondue pots too

24
00:03:18,903 --> 00:03:24,373
Cute plates 

25
00:03:24,638 --> 00:03:32,025
Now we’re trying to decide what to eat 

26
00:03:34,306 --> 00:03:38,223
It’s so peaceful💫

27
00:03:38,652 --> 00:03:43,494
We decided to go for a steak

28
00:03:43,693 --> 00:03:49,560
But the beef ragout looks so good too so we got one of those  

29
00:03:50,156 --> 00:03:56,486
Everywhere we go, you can see these crazy mountains 

30
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:04,204
But it was getting hot,, so we’re on a hunt for Ice Americano 🥵

31
00:04:04,634 --> 00:04:13,740
We just went into the cafe and asked if she could make us an ice coffee and she said yes

32
00:04:13,939 --> 00:04:18,517
Swiss people are so sweet🥺

33
00:04:24,634 --> 00:04:31,283
Back to the train station

34
00:04:31,535 --> 00:04:41,566
The view to our Airbnb

35
00:04:47,655 --> 00:04:55,439
And now we’re getting on a bus 

36
00:04:56,463 --> 00:05:02,794
The bus seems pretty similar to the German buses

37
00:05:03,358 --> 00:05:08,729
And we’re here!!! The place seems straight out of a story book 

38
00:05:09,358 --> 00:05:14,101
The top floor is our place 

39
00:05:14,696 --> 00:05:21,587
Up the stairs 

40
00:05:24,942 --> 00:05:30,346
Tada 

41
00:05:30,435 --> 00:05:39,276
We booked a relatively cheap place so we didn’t expect too much out of it 

42
00:05:41,616 --> 00:05:46,392
But the view here is amazing✨

43
00:05:49,763 --> 00:05:53,746
And from this room 

44
00:05:54,001 --> 00:05:58,976
You can see a little hill

45
00:05:59,168 --> 00:06:03,680
Cute little bathroom 

46
00:06:11,276 --> 00:06:17,077
After getting unpacked, we’re on the way to grocery shopping 

47
00:06:25,328 --> 00:06:30,000
Struggling to open this little gate 

48
00:06:30,234 --> 00:06:37,489
View from the bus stop (Swiss ver.)

49
00:06:39,196 --> 00:06:47,608
We chose the scenery over convenient location 

50
00:06:47,953 --> 00:06:54,613
So we have to take the bus and the train to go the supermarket 

51
00:07:03,466 --> 00:07:06,788
We’re here!

52
00:07:10,490 --> 00:07:16,059
Some flat peaches 

53
00:07:22,619 --> 00:07:25,710
Eggs

54
00:07:26,161 --> 00:07:31,499
most importantly,, pork belly!

55
00:07:36,477 --> 00:07:44,856
The train back to Airbnb comes every hour,, we just missed one

56
00:07:45,350 --> 00:07:52,869
So we googled and it says that there’s a gondola takes us to the bus stop instead of train 

57
00:07:53,064 --> 00:07:57,609
On the way to catch the gondola 🚡

58
00:07:57,806 --> 00:08:03,706
It was so hot and the stuff was heavy going up the hill 

59
00:08:07,107 --> 00:08:08,578
All the way up here!!

60
00:08:08,822 --> 00:08:16,672
And,, gondola was closed,,

61
00:08:17,579 --> 00:08:22,719
We hiked the hill for nothing 

62
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:28,489
But we found a statue of Sherlock Holmes on the way back 

63
00:08:28,762 --> 00:08:38,298
Apparently the waterfall where Sherlock Holmes died is in this town 

64
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:45,345
And there was a Sherlock Holmes museum but it was already closed 

65
00:08:46,157 --> 00:08:52,421
At least we get to see this scenery 

66
00:08:52,634 --> 00:08:56,914
It’s okay cuz we’re on a vacation

67
00:08:57,099 --> 00:09:01,908
So we have enough time to spare 

68
00:09:02,433 --> 00:09:08,367
We just got on the next train back to our Airbnb 

69
00:09:21,763 --> 00:09:23,631
First dinner in Swiss 

70
00:09:26,312 --> 00:09:28,081
Noodle + pork belly 

71
00:09:28,243 --> 00:09:34,407
We brought some food with us since everything is so expensive here 

72
00:09:34,778 --> 00:09:39,058
We came prepared with toast bread and jam 

73
00:09:40,313 --> 00:09:43,503
The menu isn’t too Swiss but 

74
00:09:43,734 --> 00:09:46,759
With some pork belly 

75
00:09:53,524 --> 00:09:54,929
Cheers to our grad trip 🥂

76
00:10:01,216 --> 00:10:08,107
Second day in Switzerland 

77
00:10:08,662 --> 00:10:14,231
First thing in the morning to check scenery outside 

78
00:10:14,598 --> 00:10:20,201
Some fresh air

79
00:10:20,376 --> 00:10:26,309
It rained a little so we decided to take our time till we head out 

80
00:10:27,884 --> 00:10:32,859
For brunch,, ramen noodles 

81
00:10:41,375 --> 00:10:45,523
It cleared up again 🌞

82
00:10:45,667 --> 00:10:51,038
Back to our bus stop 

83
00:10:52,369 --> 00:11:00,715
Today we’re going to Iseltwald where Crash landing on you was filmed 

84
00:11:00,998 --> 00:11:05,708
It was soooooo hot 

85
00:11:07,311 --> 00:11:10,335
Waiting in the shades

86
00:11:10,634 --> 00:11:15,261
Picture time

87
00:11:16,094 --> 00:11:20,539
On the bus

88
00:11:21,399 --> 00:11:26,142
And on the train 

89
00:11:29,443 --> 00:11:37,524
And there’s two way to get there : train and ferry 

90
00:11:38,045 --> 00:11:44,672
So we decided to take the ferry 

91
00:11:45,779 --> 00:11:49,762
The train is shaking like crazy 

92
00:11:49,971 --> 00:11:55,408
We’re getting close

93
00:11:58,648 --> 00:12:02,829
Here at the ferry dock

94
00:12:03,276 --> 00:12:06,301
I think this is the ship that’s going to take us there

95
00:12:10,876 --> 00:12:16,115
And this scenery is so unforgettable

96
00:12:18,131 --> 00:12:23,205
We didn’t really plan this trip thoroughly 

97
00:12:23,353 --> 00:12:30,839
We just thought it to be pretty but the scenery is crazy 

98
00:12:30,983 --> 00:12:38,370
Even this ferry.. we just took it cuz it was the fastest way to get there

99
00:12:38,925 --> 00:12:44,428
And now we get to see this unforgettable view 

100
00:12:55,851 --> 00:13:00,726
There was no place to sit

101
00:13:00,974 --> 00:13:09,419
So we walked around

102
00:13:12,830 --> 00:13:20,052
I wanted to come back here with my family

103
00:13:20,431 --> 00:13:24,943
Iseltwald!

104
00:13:32,345 --> 00:13:39,964
This is where he played the piano in Crash landing on you 🎹

105
00:13:40,233 --> 00:13:45,108
I actually haven’t seen the show

106
00:13:48,348 --> 00:13:57,388
Iseltwald was quite small and that was all they have 

107
00:13:57,631 --> 00:14:03,333
But still the scenery was so beautiful 

108
00:14:06,001 --> 00:14:15,933
Since the people are lining up to take pictures we decided to get coffee first 

109
00:14:36,423 --> 00:14:38,820
People on the ferry are waving so I waved them back 

110
00:14:40,604 --> 00:14:43,629
One of the ignorant kids did the chinky eye with his fingers

111
00:14:46,829 --> 00:14:51,837
I still regret not flipping him off

112
00:14:55,106 --> 00:15:00,400
Let’s try not to ruin my mood cuz of one ignorant person’s disrespectful behavior

113
00:15:08,216 --> 00:15:12,265
Back to the photo zone 📸

114
00:15:24,046 --> 00:15:27,335
It was our turn to take a picture 

115
00:15:27,541 --> 00:15:32,449
But one lady started to getting tanned after laying down her towel in the middle of the deck 

116
00:15:32,522 --> 00:15:36,736
So we waited for nothing and took our picture in the corner of the deck 

117
00:15:36,918 --> 00:15:40,075
It’s time to go home 

118
00:15:40,421 --> 00:15:46,288
Back on the ferry 

119
00:15:46,635 --> 00:15:50,552
And to the train 

120
00:15:50,948 --> 00:15:55,493
And we’re in Interlaken for dinner 

121
00:15:56,046 --> 00:16:00,822
It seems familiar now 

122
00:16:00,905 --> 00:16:07,499
But still had to stop by the gift shop 

123
00:16:07,780 --> 00:16:13,680
So I got a new postcard 

124
00:16:20,833 --> 00:16:27,295
We came here for Haxen but it’s only available in the weekend 

125
00:16:29,166 --> 00:16:34,141
Barbecue rib!

126
00:16:34,677 --> 00:16:41,734
The beer was good and the rib was also really good 

127
00:16:45,417 --> 00:16:49,863
Second round is Guinness 

128
00:16:50,385 --> 00:16:54,533
Now back to our Airbnb 

129
00:16:54,752 --> 00:17:01,908
This spot is where all the paragliders land 

130
00:17:08,338 --> 00:17:13,808
We were exhausted on the way back 

131
00:17:14,198 --> 00:17:18,809
Another train ride 

132
00:17:18,858 --> 00:17:24,196
Bus ride

133
00:17:24,829 --> 00:17:29,076
Went to bed right off

134
00:17:34,964 --> 00:17:39,509
Last day

135
00:17:42,610 --> 00:17:47,320
So peaceful

136
00:17:48,486 --> 00:17:51,511
Getting ready for breakfast

137
00:18:01,608 --> 00:18:11,474
Ice tea from Germany

138
00:18:12,523 --> 00:18:17,795
And we’re almost emptying our fridge 

139
00:18:32,702 --> 00:18:36,000
I got this now

140
00:18:36,265 --> 00:18:44,346
And the view is breathtaking 

141
00:18:47,520 --> 00:18:53,868
We’re going to Luzern today 

142
00:19:00,250 --> 00:19:05,225
Train ride is always fun and beautiful 

143
00:19:11,077 --> 00:19:15,093
It really seems like a city 

144
00:19:25,980 --> 00:19:30,624
We’re here in Luzern!

145
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:39,031
It’s such a city compared to last to yesterday 

146
00:19:39,411 --> 00:19:47,658
Carpel bridge and a herd of maggots 

147
00:19:50,186 --> 00:19:56,317
There were so many 

148
00:19:57,475 --> 00:20:03,739
But the bridge was still pretty

149
00:20:04,798 --> 00:20:10,764
Once crossed the bridge

150
00:20:13,393 --> 00:20:17,673
We’re going to Starbucks 

151
00:20:17,880 --> 00:20:23,846
Why is Starbucks even so pretty here in Switzerland 

152
00:20:26,728 --> 00:20:30,000
 should I get one...

153
00:20:36,231 --> 00:20:41,867
Terrace outside isn’t that romantic nor great

154
00:20:41,867 --> 00:20:47,866
Cuz of all the pigeons

155
00:20:55,233 --> 00:21:03,083
I loved coffee time here

156
00:21:03,535 --> 00:21:08,609
More scenery

157
00:21:11,338 --> 00:21:19,518
It was so pretty everywhere we go

158
00:21:25,588 --> 00:21:31,157
How is this possible

159
00:21:33,031 --> 00:21:38,006
On our way to see the Lion sculpture 

160
00:21:43,393 --> 00:21:53,193
This was made to commemorate Swiss soldiers who died during the French Revolution 

161
00:21:55,240 --> 00:22:02,594
I thought it’d be one of those disappointing/ overrated statues in Europe 

162
00:22:02,802 --> 00:22:09,793
But is was so much bigger than what I expected and the face of the lion was impressive

163
00:22:09,980 --> 00:22:14,789
To the food court for lunch 

164
00:22:15,045 --> 00:22:20,284
We’re not too desperate for Swiss food so we’re just going to get something from here

165
00:22:20,812 --> 00:22:26,481
It was better than what I expected 👀

166
00:22:41,360 --> 00:22:45,211
It was pretty good actually!

167
00:22:45,367 --> 00:22:52,093
It was getting really hot so we decided to go back 

168
00:22:55,906 --> 00:23:01,839
On the way to the main train station 

169
00:23:02,220 --> 00:23:15,477
It was for a brief visit but I think Luzern is a beautiful city where I can see myself living here 

170
00:23:17,336 --> 00:23:24,657
I even googled whether they have master program for psychology

171
00:23:25,086 --> 00:23:32,374
We had some time left till our train

172
00:23:32,776 --> 00:23:39,701
So we went shopping to the gift store

173
00:23:39,708 --> 00:23:44,385
Another postcard 

174
00:23:44,766 --> 00:23:49,245
Since it’s too hot out

175
00:23:50,270 --> 00:23:53,823
We’re back in another Starbucks 

176
00:23:54,644 --> 00:23:59,817
And I got the Luzern cup from here!

177
00:24:00,301 --> 00:24:09,704
Now on the way to the train 

178
00:24:19,983 --> 00:24:26,048
Views from the train &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;

179
00:24:28,395 --> 00:24:33,535
This is also a place where they filmed crash landing on you

180
00:24:33,585 --> 00:24:37,865
But it was too hot so we’re just going to pass by 

181
00:24:41,617 --> 00:24:47,186
Bus ride back to our Airbnb 

182
00:24:47,666 --> 00:24:54,624
And the way back 

183
00:24:57,038 --> 00:25:00,856
We almost melted cuz of the heat 🥵

184
00:25:00,996 --> 00:25:06,400
Chilling a little till the sun goes down 

185
00:25:06,746 --> 00:25:15,521
Last walk around 

186
00:25:19,696 --> 00:25:25,199
And now to packing

187
00:25:31,943 --> 00:25:38,339
Last dinner was leftover pork belly

188
00:25:38,580 --> 00:25:42,530
With cup noodles

189
00:25:46,940 --> 00:25:53,699
Chatting with my friend 

190
00:25:54,186 --> 00:25:59,293
And calling it a day watching our favorite show 💫

191
00:26:02,639 --> 00:26:07,415
Last breakfast in Switzerland

192
00:26:08,549 --> 00:26:12,565
We finished all the food we brought 

193
00:26:12,829 --> 00:26:19,489
Now it’s time to go back home 

194
00:26:25,306 --> 00:26:31,900
View out of the window for the last time

195
00:26:36,211 --> 00:26:42,144
It’s been real

196
00:26:42,986 --> 00:26:48,000
Leaving notes

197
00:26:53,763 --> 00:26:58,837
Returning the keys

198
00:27:09,829 --> 00:27:15,531
Hard goodbye to this beautiful place

199
00:27:24,325 --> 00:27:34,191
I liked everything about this trip

200
00:27:41,552 --> 00:27:48,311
I always felt a little unease after traveling

201
00:27:48,622 --> 00:27:53,332
But maybe because of the person I was with

202
00:27:53,804 --> 00:27:59,109
Or because of the location I chose

203
00:27:59,580 --> 00:28:04,654
Or maybe because it was a trip after graduating

204
00:28:04,803 --> 00:28:14,603
I was able to truly enjoy the trip from the beginning 

205
00:28:14,866 --> 00:28:21,361
Even though I thought of my family back home throughout the trip

206
00:28:21,649 --> 00:28:27,582
I’m going to take them here for sure someday

207
00:28:35,492 --> 00:28:43,243
On the train back to Freiburg

208
00:28:43,661 --> 00:28:49,032
It’s really time to say goodbye to Switzerland

209
00:28:52,687 --> 00:28:57,860
And we’re here in Freiburg again!

210
00:29:09,171 --> 00:29:14,873
Back to my daily life

211
00:29:16,413 --> 00:29:21,685
And back to home

